OL,3,GNEWSANew hub aims to get young people
OL,4,Ainto work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new Careers and Skills Hub has opened
OL,7,Fin Wolverhampton to help more young
OL,8,Fpeople into work.
OL,10,FIt comes as new government data has
OL,11,Fshown that more than 2,500 youngsters
OL,12,Faged 18 to 24 years old in the city are
OL,13,Fclaiming out-of-work benefits, with the
OL,14,Fyouth unemployment rate almost twice
OL,15,Fthe national average.
OL,17,FHosted at the City Learning Quarter
OL,18,FCampus on St George's Parade, it is
OL,19,Fhoped it will become a one-stop shop
OL,20,Ffor residents to find out about job
OL,21,Fopportunities, training courses and
OL,22,Fpreparation for work programmes.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
