OL,3,GNEWSANew hub aims to get young people
OL,4,Ainto work
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Secretary of State for Work and
OL,7,FPensions and Labour Wolverhampton South
OL,8,FEast MP Pat McFadden told the BBC that
OL,9,Fthe hub could be a model for supporting
OL,10,Fyoung people nationally.
